. As he roams the wasteland in pursuit of his sworn enemy Shin, who stole his fiancée Yuria, Kenshiro answers the cries of the oppressed, becoming a beacon of hope in a world of despair.\n\nStanding in his path are brutal survivors of the apocalypse, their ambitions twisted by power and greed. In a world where the weak are prey and prayers go unheard, Kenshiro forges a path with his iron fists!\n\n(Source: Official Website)"},"tags":[{"name":"CGI","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Full CGI","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":77,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Gore","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":60,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"FIST OF THE NORTH STAR: HOKUTO NO KEN","english":"FIST OF THE NORTH STAR: HOKUTO NO KEN","native":"北斗の拳 -FIST OF THE NORTH STAR-","romaji":"Hokuto no Ken: FIST OF THE NORTH STAR","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"北斗神拳 -FIST OF THE NORTH STAR-"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Gux_dYHDMK4","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Gux_dYHDMK4/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}